The public headers of the Independent JPEG Group's libjpeg 9d (9.4.0), as
installed by its own `./configure` on Linux. Only the headers: the library is
the one the stock firmware already carries, /usr/lib/libjpeg.so.9, opened at
run time by jpeg_scaled.c. The struct layout has to match that build exactly
(jpeg_CreateDecompress checks the version and the struct size), which is why
these are the 9d headers and not the build machine's libjpeg-turbo ones.

This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.
